{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "5a1e3ddee962f00a6a111258fe3921d5d80d26eda3858b0e5c6be005503317be", "ja": "繊細で綺麗なデザインですね。\n私が動くと、リボンの房が揺れて……ふふ、可愛い♪", "zh": "设计得既精致又漂亮呢。只要我一动，丝带穗子就会跟着摇曳……呵呵，好可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "d8fd4c9f9dc45bfbe36513e470b75ac1d72efc37293fb5dacb40cc82fa1f1cf1", "ja": "なんだか、私のことを考えて作ってもらえた気がして、\nすっごく嬉しいです……♪　えへへ、似合ってますか？", "zh": "总觉得这件衣服像是专门为我设计的一样，\n我真的特别开心……♪ 嘿嘿，适合我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d481e869a28cbc1a68f3958f7e15a7659c54290ae9fea1be98c3ff93110cbe4c", "ja": "うん、バッチリだよ！　春香によく似合ってる。\nあとは着こなしが板に付けば……。", "zh": "嗯，非常完美！很适合春香。\n接下来只要穿得越来越顺手……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "6876b421a6ebd719fdd4d82ee66cc65dc9f0fecc88c25d5b3b3911e2b0748b42", "ja": "そうですね。和風の衣装ですし、\n雰囲気に合った着こなしや表現を身につけたいな。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟是和风服装，\n我想掌握与这种氛围相称的穿搭和表现方式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "40c6de03d21def3b537069842bc1f35c067ecda976d4b73d21d9133b3b9be77c", "ja": "そうだ！　ちょっとだけ、練習してみてもいいですか？\nどんな風に見えるのか、一度みておきたくて。", "zh": "对了！可以让我稍微练习一下吗？\n我想先试试看，穿上后会呈现出什么样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bca71ca125dc7d3a411c4ba1c62b8d748ef38ba790b1192167de3045194b836d", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\nしかし、その衣装にあった見せ方というと……。", "zh": "啊，当然可以。\n不过，要配合那套服装来展示的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "f6cf35cddbca46894aeebf076831255aa759d545a26b8152169dbd63b58fff5d", "ja": "うーん……難しいですね。\n明るくて、可愛い感じ……も、いいんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……有点难呢。\n明快又可爱的感觉……也不错，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "a250b9ed71d781b31a5d6a0ca72ac55c9bc3346d7a1c409f229c4bba54404f83", "ja": "どちらかというと、穏やかで……表情じゃなくて、\n雰囲気で、綺麗だと思ってもらえたらいいのかも。", "zh": "真要说的话，我更希望是温柔平和的感觉……不是靠表情，而是让人觉得整体氛围很美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1008_p", "source_sha256": "04d763678ff8509cebdc8de8fbfd75c26aa01b09ba587568b95968508227df39", "ja": "なるほど。確かに、和を意識した空気感が出せたら、\n表現の幅がグッと広がりそうだな。", "zh": "原来如此。确实，要是能营造出注重和风的氛围，表现方式的范围也会大大拓宽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "e760bdf0e4a595b23421d3b5025b7820151ac66790dc42f6833043982c3226f8", "ja": "はい！　それじゃ、しっかり見てて下さいね。\n和風の雰囲気を……よし。", "zh": "好的！那么，请仔细看好了。\n和风的感觉……好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "ae642c969ab837ee10e939f66bdfb8603abeaa1c04b9688a0db41bb672550fd0", "ja": "…………。っ……！", "zh": "…………。呃……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "4e20b0bae1a60f18d3a7847912de7ad5aa3371de52a4ea38ad940bdded7249db", "ja": "うう、ごめんなさい～！　ジッと見つめられると\nなんだか、恥ずかしくなってきちゃって……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起～！被你一直这么盯着看，\n总觉得，怪不好意思的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1012_p", "source_sha256": "28b2d232e263eb407a56b79a28a816f13e742f5522aab68a1a150cf944045230", "ja": "ええ！　ご、ごめん！\nでも出だしの雰囲気は、よかったと思うよ。", "zh": "是、对、对不起！  \n不过我觉得开头的感觉挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "b8778dd453583c2ec165d2cde9eb62b8d81478c579aceb29600caf6b08e89f4e", "ja": "いえ、甘やかしちゃダメです。今のは練習として……\nもう一回、チャレンジさせてください！", "zh": "不，可不能这么惯着我。刚才的就算作练习……\n请让我再挑战一次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "c5fec23b0af69d408c879cd07bf268408c184d5399998df9dfd8512e95698ecd", "ja": "ふぅ……。\nどうでしたか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "呼……。\n怎么样，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3628fc191b3a67f2a9f128409ab922d743e527bb559405028050580ab152fa0b", "ja": "……おお。和の魅力というか、\n趣のある美しさが出てて、素敵だったよ！", "zh": "……喔。有种和风的魅力，\n而且展现出了古典风雅之美，非常棒哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "df15a2956d99c0b0181c350872cc2e3ec2b044bf6c17398a066f33bd39ce1243", "ja": "本当ですか？　えへへ、よかった～♪　練習、\n付き合ってくださって、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，那太好了～♪谢谢您陪我练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5fa1a0c7e27087b88fa0dc8be617b56d9d454022737caa6f2a9faa9fe66fe99b", "ja": "いや、いいんだ。\nこういう練習は、ひとりじゃ難しいだろうからな。", "zh": "不，没关系。\n这种练习，一个人做起来很困难吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "c0ce2c6e0d987db5973ab4d773493ea583c3069d20cbd8fac98546eeb0fca47a", "ja": "はい……あ、{$P$}さん。\nそれなら、また次も付き合ってもらっていいですか？", "zh": "好的……啊，{$P$}先生。那么，下次也可以再陪我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_001har0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_001har0564_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "f288d66436d44dbfc21322e71aa38117a50eb3974d5613933d8a76846654cd33", "ja": "{$P$}さん相手だとドキドキ……あ、\nいえ、いい緊張感で練習できますから！　……えへへ♪", "zh": "和{$P$}先生当对手的话会让人心跳……啊，\n不是的，是能带着良好的紧张感练习！……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
